## Documentation discipline

Same edit batch as code: update `STATE.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and `CLIENT_DOCS.md` (when client-visible). Update `PROJECT_MAP.md` on structural changes. Append-only `CHANGELOG.md`. After ANY user correction: append a lesson to `LESSONS.md` (pattern + root cause + preventive rule) BEFORE continuing. See `PROJECT_RULES.md` §3.1.

